om/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":680,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T06:25:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":18,"created_at":"2017-10-25T20:43:18Z","updated_at":"2020-07-26T16:14:21Z","closed_at":"2020-06-25T18:56:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## I'm submitting a...\r\n<!-- Check one of the following options with \"x\" -->\r\n<pre><code>\r\n[X ] Regression (a behavior that used to work and stopped working in a new release)\r\n[X ] Bug report  <!-- Please search GitHub for a similar issue or PR before submitting -->\r\n[ ] Feature request\r\n[ ] Documentation issue or request\r\n[ ] Support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\nWhen using the `routerLinkActive` directive inside a component that is using `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` and lazy loaded module routes the `routerLinkActive` directive does not update after clicking a link to a lazy loaded route that has not already been loaded.\r\n\r\nAlso the `OnPush` nav component does not set `routerLinkActive` correctly when the default route loads, the non-`OnPush` nav component works fine.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\nThe `routerLinkActive` directive updates the element correctly when navigating to a lazy loaded route for the first time.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\nMy reproduction - https://github.com/seangwright/ng-bug-on-push-routerlinkactive\r\n\r\nLive - https://seangwright.github.io/ng-bug-on-push-routerlinkactive/ng-bug-on-push-routerlinkactive\r\n\r\nThis is a very simple app. There are two lazy routes and two eager routes. There are two navs, one with `OnPush` and one without it.\r\n\r\n`npm i && npm start`\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\nI would prefer to be able to set all my components to `OnPush` for change detection but it doesn't look like this is going to work correctly with the combination I described above.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nAngular CLI: 1.5.0-rc.3\r\nNode: 8.6.0\r\nOS: win32 x64\r\nAngular: 4.4.6\r\n... animations, common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, forms\r\n... http, language-service, platform-browser\r\n... platform-browser-dynamic, router, tsc-wrapped\r\n\r\n@angular/cli: 1.5.0-rc.3\r\n@angular-devkit/build-optimizer: 0.0.31\r\n@angular-devkit/core: 0.0.20\r\n@angular-devkit/schematics: 0.0.34\r\n@ngtools/json-schema: 1.1.0\r\n@ngtools/webpack: 1.8.0-rc.3\r\n@schematics/angular: 0.0.48\r\ntypescript: 2.3.4\r\nwebpack: 3.8.1\r\n\r\nBrowser:\r\n- [ X] Chrome (desktop) version 61.0.3163\r\n- [ ] Chrome (Android) version XX\r\n- [ ] Chrome (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] Firefox version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (desktop) version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] IE version XX\r\n- [ ] Edge version XX\r\n \r\nFor Tooling issues:\r\n- Node version: 8.6.0\r\n- Platform:  Windows 10 x64\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AndrewKushnir","id":43554145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTU0MTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43554145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/And